    "title": "Claude Grades Its Own Work — This Fixes It",
    "source_text": "New Tool Addresses Claude's Grading Flaw.\nClaudeX Loop solves Claude's biggest issue: grading its own work.\nThis innovative skill introduces a second AI, Codex, to review and critique Claude's plans and executions. By implementing a feedback loop, it ensures that Claude's outputs are evaluated before moving forward, enhancing reliability. The process includes reconnaissance, interrogation, and multiple review stages, allowing for comprehensive oversight. This could significantly improve the quality of AI-generated work. If you want the link, just comment loop.",
